			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3737124">
									

<p>A majority of my nightmares, inexplicably, take place in the house I lived in from 1987 to 1997. It wasn't the first place that I have lived in, it wasn't the longest I have lived in the same place, I come from a stable loving family, and nothing more traumatic than ordinary white male suburban adolescence occurred to me there. That this place is the principle setting of terror for my subconscious (and not say, the killing streets of Ar Ramadi), is in and of itself disturbing in its incongruity. That D-6042 returns to that house as well hit me fairly close to where fear lives.</p>

